00:10:18.583 --> 00:10:19.695
The CLI

00:10:20.665 --> 00:10:23.026
lolly runs any tool from the terminal

00:10:23.121 --> 00:10:25.508
through the same engine and the same

00:10:25.568 --> 00:10:29.158
render path as the web shell — it is URL

00:10:29.229 --> 00:10:31.977
mode under a different transport, so

00:10:32.042 --> 00:10:36.395
