00:10:37.205 --> 00:10:39.868
url=x.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.309
That makes it the build-pipeline, CI and

00:10:43.371 --> 00:10:47.003
scripting surface: generate an OG card at

00:10:47.064 --> 00:10:51.816
build time, fan a CSV out into 400 badges,

00:10:51.882 --> 00:10:55.419
