00:11:37.022 --> 00:11:38.353
Development

00:11:39.263 --> 00:11:41.569
New contributor?

00:11:42.347 --> 00:11:45.238
Start at CONTRIBUTING-md — it routes you

00:11:45.316 --> 00:11:47.443
through the recursive clone, content

00:11:47.503 --> 00:11:52.002
profiles, the tools//catalog/ symlink-view

00:11:52.064 --> 00:11:55.247
trap, which repo owns which file, and the

00:11:55.308 --> 00:11:58.345
commands to run before a PR.

00:11:59.113 --> 00:12:02.322
Auditors and anyone touching a parser or a

00:12:02.384 --> 00:12:04.294
crypto module should read

00:12:04.365 --> 00:12:06.788
docs/threat-model-md and

00:12:06.849 --> 00:12:09.694
docs/parser-inventory-md.

00:12:10.075 --> 00:12:17.250
Lolly is an umbrella repo composed of git submodules «see Repository layout».

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:23.650
That changes two things: how you clone, and where each change is committed.

00:12:24.397 --> 00:12:26.717
Clone / update

00:12:27.697 --> 00:12:30.518
Code example omitted.

00:12:31.276 --> 00:12:33.899
Each submodule is checked out on its own

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.251
main, tracking its repo under

00:12:36.314 --> 00:12:39.919
github-com/lolly-tools/*.

00:12:40.688 --> 00:12:43.772
Where your changes go — the umbrella pins

00:12:43.855 --> 00:12:47.204
a specific commit of each submodule, so a

00:12:47.268 --> 00:12:50.122
change is committed to the repo that owns

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:53.086
the file, then the umbrella records the

00:12:53.146 --> 00:12:54.595
new pointer.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.848
The full path-to-repo ownership table

00:12:57.918 --> 00:13:02.010
lives in CONTRIBUTING-md §4, which is the

00:13:02.141 --> 00:13:04.944
single source of truth for it.

00:13:05.325 --> 00:13:14.875
⚠️ Committing from the umbrella root does not capture edits made inside a submodule — git only sees the pointer.

00:13:15.225 --> 00:13:20.225
Commit inside the submodule, or use loldev «below».

00:13:20.575 --> 00:13:31.800
The tools/ and catalog/ views are symlinks into the packs, so editing through them lands in the right pack checkout automatically.

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:47.150
Editing a SUSE tool touches two repos «suse-lolly + umbrella pointer»; a community tool touches three «lolly-tools manifest, suse-lolly regenerated index, umbrella pointer».

00:13:47.914 --> 00:13:51.619
loldev — one command to ship a change.

00:13:52.388 --> 00:13:55.249
A helper that does the multi-repo dance

00:13:55.349 --> 00:13:56.694
for you.

00:13:57.489 --> 00:14:00.418
Install it on your PATH:

00:14:01.197 --> 00:14:04.018
Code example omitted.

00:14:04.797 --> 00:14:07.618
Code example omitted.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:15.725
loldev operates on ~/Build/lolly by default «override with LOLLY_ROOT».

00:14:16.075 --> 00:14:29.575
The underlying scripts live in scripts/subrepo/ — sync-sh, status-sh, verify-sh, plus migrate-sh/snap-history-sh «the one-time split».

